  "implementation": [
    "DownstreamControl admits its actual Arc pointee, inline Dispatch mutex and final guard before global begin. Each profile shares one admitted Arc<Retained<FullLoopControl>> between active dispatch and numerical execution before pause/science publication.",
    "Preview Job and execution share one admitted Arc<Retained<TransmitterPreviewControl>> before status clearing, channel creation or spawn. Rejection preserves accepted source/result/configuration/revision/notice. Product receipt is not treated as worker termination.",
    "UpstreamControl has one fallible constructor and a private nonoptional final guard covering its full adapter/backend graph. Start validates actual budget identity before backend claim and returns the original unstarted lease on foreign control.",
    "DS/preview wrappers replace the inline scientific handle already in public metadata with the final Retained wrapper layout and add one outer shared root: three roots, zero ordered entries. US replaces its backend handle with the whole adapter and adds one root: two roots, or three with common cancellation.",
    "No scientific algorithm, public API, binding, manifest, registration, saved schema or QML implementation changes. No repeated charge for existing counter/gate/Sessions/Context Stores. Existing partial-result, cancellation and genuine-terminal behavior remains."
  ],
